  "prefLabel": "Plc 903.02 Advisory Board Officers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 903.02 Advisory Board Officers. Annually, at the first meeting of the calendar year, the duly-appointed advisory board members shall elect, from among the advisory board members, a chair and a vice chair.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
